#!/bin/sh
# Aide des raccourcis Hyprland, en deux niveaux (sections, puis raccourcis).
# Lit les descriptions directement depuis Hyprland (hyprctl binds).
# Format attendu des descriptions dans binds.lua : "Section: texte".

all="Tous les raccourcis (recherche)"

list=$(hyprctl binds -j | jq -r '.[] | select(.description != "") | [.modmask, .key, .description] | @tsv' | awk -F'\t' '
function keyname(k) {
    if (k ~ /^code:1[0-9]$/) { n = substr(k, 6) - 9; return (n == 10) ? "0" : n }
    if (k == "code:20") return "Moins"
    if (k == "code:21") return "Égal"
    if (k == "SUPER_L") return ""
    if (k == "Return") return "Entrée"
    if (k == "Space") return "Espace"
    if (k == "Escape") return "Échap"
    if (k == "BackSpace") return "Retour arrière"
    if (k == "Print") return "Impr. écran"
    if (k == "Left") return "←"
    if (k == "Right") return "→"
    if (k == "Up") return "↑"
    if (k == "Down") return "↓"
    if (k == "Comma") return "Virgule"
    if (k == "Period") return "Point"
    if (k == "Backslash") return "\\"
    if (k == "mouse:272") return "clic gauche"
    if (k == "mouse:273") return "clic droit"
    if (k == "mouse_down") return "molette ↓"
    if (k == "mouse_up") return "molette ↑"
    if (k == "XF86AudioPlay") return "Lecture"
    return k
}
{
    m = $1; combo = ""
    if (int(m / 64) % 2) combo = combo "Super + "
    if (int(m / 4) % 2)  combo = combo "Ctrl + "
    if (int(m / 8) % 2)  combo = combo "Alt + "
    if (m % 2)           combo = combo "Shift + "
    k = keyname($2)
    combo = (k == "") ? substr(combo, 1, length(combo) - 3) " (seul)" : combo k

    i = index($3, ": ")
    sec = (i > 0) ? substr($3, 1, i - 1) : "Divers"
    txt = (i > 0) ? substr($3, i + 2) : $3
    if (!(sec in seen)) { seen[sec] = 1; order[++n] = sec }
    items[sec] = items[sec] combo "\t" txt "\n"
}
END { for (j = 1; j <= n; j++) printf "\t%s\n%s", order[j], items[order[j]] }
')

if [ -z "$list" ]; then
    echo "Aucun raccourci décrit trouvé (Hyprland est-il lancé ?)."
    sleep 3
    exit 1
fi

while true; do
    section=$( { echo "$all"; printf '%s\n' "$list" | awk -F'\t' '$1 == "" { print $2 }'; } | fzf \
        --prompt='Sections › ' \
        --header='Entrée ou double-clic pour ouvrir · Échap pour fermer' \
        --layout=reverse --no-sort --info=hidden --no-scrollbar ) || exit 0

    printf '%s\n' "$list" | awk -F'\t' -v s="$section" -v all="$all" '
        $1 == "" { cur = $2; next }
        NF >= 2 && (s == all || cur == s) { printf "\033[36m%-32s\033[0m %s\n", $1, $2 }
    ' | fzf --ansi \
        --prompt="$section › " \
        --header='Tape pour chercher · Échap pour revenir aux sections' \
        --layout=reverse --no-sort --info=hidden --no-scrollbar \
        --pointer=' ' --bind='enter:ignore'
done
